OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber                     
OL,5,CToday:FA cold and grey morning with    
OL,6,Ffrost at first over high ground.       
OL,7,FCloudy through the afternoon and       
OL,8,Fremaining cold inland, but milder and  
OL,9,Fbreezier along the coast.              
OL,11,CTonight:FGenerally cloudy and dry, but 
OL,12,Fa few showers are possible towards the 
OL,13,Feast and in particular along the       
OL,14,Fcoast. Becoming chilly with a frost    
OL,15,Fpossible over higher ground.           
OL,17,CThursday:FRather cloudy through        
OL,18,FThursday with some showers possible at 
OL,19,Ffirst towards the coast. Perhaps a few 
OL,20,Fbright spells during the afternoon.    
OL,21,FTurning cold and frosty overnight.     
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
