OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber                     
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy   
OL,6,Fon Friday with rain and hill snow      
OL,7,Fgradually spreading east and becoming  
OL,8,Fcold overnight. Outbreaks of rain or   
OL,9,Fsleet on Saturday. Becoming brighter   
OL,10,Fby Sunday with sunny spells.           
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
